      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "AI agents initiated 14 million transfers through the x402 protocol in the 30 days to Aug 17 — roughly 75M total ecosystem transactions, $24M in volume, $0.32 average payment size. That's up ~4.5x from the 3.1M transfers / $1.2M reported for the 30 days to May 29, and Base remains the dominant settlement chain."
